{
  "version": "1.1",
  "description": "Kiko search-quality golden set. Each case represents a real or plausible user query (KO/EN text). The harness embeds the input via Modal, runs search_products_v6, and scores the top-K against `expected` attributes. Ground truth is attribute-based (subcategory/keywords/color/fit) not product_id — cheap to curate and forward-compatible with catalog growth. Add a `whitelist_ids` field on individual cases to enforce stricter ground truth over time. Subcategory values follow the Vision v2 taxonomy in app/channels/vision_prompt.py (dashes, lowercase); the harness does substring matching so alternative forms are tolerated.",
  "subcategory_taxonomy_note": "Canonical values (see vision_prompt.py STANDARDIZED ITEM ENUMS): Outer=overcoat/trench-coat/parka/bomber/blazer/cardigan/vest/anorak/leather-jacket/denim-jacket/fleece/windbreaker/cape/poncho/shearling/down-jacket/field-jacket/chore-jacket/overshirt/hoodie. Top=t-shirt/shirt/blouse/polo/sweater/knit-top/tank-top/crop-top/henley/turtleneck/sweatshirt/rugby-shirt/camisole. Bottom=jeans/trousers/chinos/shorts/skirt/joggers/cargo-pants/wide-pants/leggings/culottes/sweatpants. Shoes=sneakers/boots/loafers/derby/oxford/sandals/mules/heels/flats/slides/chelsea-boots/combat-boots/running-shoes. Bag=tote/crossbody/backpack/clutch/shoulder-bag/belt-bag/messenger/bucket-bag/briefcase. Dress=mini-dress/midi-dress/maxi-dress/shirt-dress/wrap-dress/slip-dress/knit-dress. NOTE: 'capri' has no enum — closest is trousers/shorts. 'ballet(-flat)' has no enum — closest is flats. 'mini-skirt' has no enum — 'skirt' alone is used.",
  "metrics": {
    "subcat_hit_at_k": "fraction of top-K whose subcategory ∈ expected.subcategory_any (substring match)",
    "keyword_hit_at_k": "fraction of top-K whose name/brand matches ANY expected.keywords_any",
    "color_hit_at_k": "fraction of top-K whose name matches ANY expected.color_any",
    "fit_hit_at_k": "fraction of top-K whose name matches ANY expected.fit_any",
    "brand_diversity_at_k": "count of unique brands in top-K (higher = more diverse)",
    "distance_p50_at_k": "median distance of top-K (lower = more confident retrieval)",
    "quality_score": "geometric mean of subcat_hit and keyword_hit (single-number summary; 0 if either is 0)"
  },
  "notes": [
    "Subcategory tokens should preferably match the Vision v2 enum (dashes, lowercase). Substring `token in subcategory` matching means `jean` will hit `jeans`, but `denim_jacket` will NOT hit `denim-jacket` — always use dashes.",
    "`expected.color_any`/`fit_any` are OPTIONAL — omit when the query doesn't imply them.",
    "`gender` field is metadata only — the raw RPC harness does not use it (that logic lives in app-layer search_products tool)."
  ],
  "cases": [
